                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Yet another Five Nights at Freddy's-esque game. Nice graphics, nice atmosphere as well with the radio news and the rain pouring outside.\n\nHowever, I couldn't really enjoy it. First of all, lacks any customization: the mouse sensibility is way too high for me, can't adjust resolution, can't choose fullscreen or windowed and the game doesn't end properly, requiring me to kill the process.\n\nThe gameplay is the basic \"keep checking if everything is doing OK\", with some randomized features to help you. I'm yet to figure why I've died, though: looks like Sparky always get me in a well lit room, with windows closed...",
